{# Deadlines & Time-Sensitive Items -- rendered FIRST, before CIRAC (v1 "detect + hedge").
   Every item is hedged: a computed date is always presented as an estimate to verify,
   and events without a matching rule are surfaced as "date unclear". #}
# ⏰ Deadlines & Time-Sensitive Items

> **Read this first.** Missing a legal deadline can end a case. The dates below are
> estimates generated automatically — **always confirm the exact date with the court
> or a lawyer.**

{% for d in context.deadlines %}
{% if d.urgency == "lapsed" %}
## ⛔ {{ d.event_text }} — DEADLINE MAY HAVE PASSED
{% else %}
## ⚠️ {{ d.event_text }}
{% endif %}
{% if d.computed and d.computed_date %}
- **Estimated deadline:** {{ d.computed_date }}
{% if d.citation %}
- **Basis:** {{ d.citation }}
{% endif %}
{% else %}
- **Estimated deadline:** date unclear — this time-sensitive item needs an exact date.
{% endif %}
{% if d.trigger_date %}
- **Triggering event:** {{ d.trigger | replace("_", " ") }} on {{ d.trigger_date }}
{% endif %}
{% if d.jurisdiction %}
- **Jurisdiction:** {{ d.jurisdiction }}
{% endif %}
- *{{ d.hedge }}*

{% endfor %}
